      3 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شاولهُ</span></b> : see 1, latter half. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also, and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شاول</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">بِهِ</span>, and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شاول بِهِ فِى الطِّعَانِ</span>, [inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُشَاوَلَةٌ</span>,] <i>He
