(TA.) See also 6. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شاول الفَحْلُ الفَحْلَ</span>
<i>The stallion</i> [<i>camel</i>] <i>fought with,</i> or <i>combated, the
stallion</i> [<i>camel</i>]. (Ham p. 660.)

